{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "0DTJ", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-points-conditions}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8e52f9c1b82c0b9aa8df8d8fb75cf102d4d2916d41ba4eef76053aea92644d67", "source_text": "Finiteness conditions and points", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1ce08643651526cad519498b391710091e126c3d587d9d6173181d92f305cbcc", "unit_id": "tag:0DTJ:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0DTJ", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{decent-spaces-section-points-monomorphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:773c6a523e6d511c315f3652514687b96d8d0bd16d20ca69ddce93ef291f17f4", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThis section is the analogue of\nDecent Spaces, Section <REF_0001>\nfor points of algebraic stacks.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:59dc92cbe5b5ec9f71dfcf6010e56fd2f88d2325081c77c57b6beabc9de88de9", "unit_id": "tag:0DTJ:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DTJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$x \\in |\\mathcal{X}|$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Spec(k) \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$x$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Spec(k) \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$x$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-UR-quasi-compact-above-x}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:cf5b502997dfcc67de1d7dbc9d2b20c34ee913ab656c028b02782b2f73f6e338", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:576dca9d9cc6f535f3a76c110e8819510c04101bbe6c426f056c9887f9f84e08", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a point. The following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> some morphism <MATH_0003> in the equivalence\nclass of <MATH_0004> is quasi-compact, and\n<STRUCT_0003> any morphism <MATH_0005> in the equivalence\nclass of <MATH_0006> is quasi-compact.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3ce71a2e0d2bda35377121a6aa1e365e9472ebdc5aa8a72da8bbbf4cc16ceefc", "unit_id": "tag:0DTK:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0DTJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Spec(k) \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$x$", "MATH_0003": "$k'/k$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Spec(k) \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Spec(k') \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-surjection-from-quasi-compact}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebraic-lemma-representable-transformations-property-implication}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:39bbdd44507427b4b88213628488d0bd9b3df51befaa1fc342f0b867f8e6f5f9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fc225fda81d5c34e7bdcd5dd633f337a0109b69345d6dd6f65e6b97c38a4d7c7", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be in the equivalence\nclass of <MATH_0002>. Let <MATH_0003> be a field extension.\nThen we have to show that <MATH_0004> is\nquasi-compact if and only if <MATH_0005>\nis quasi-compact. This follows from\nMorphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0001>\nand the principle of Algebraic Stacks, Lemma\n<REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5efd2a473a7e82ddf929416beafd33501a613d8cecca79831ea267fc2ec8fa53", "unit_id": "tag:0DTK:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0DTJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$x \\in |\\mathcal{X}|$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-UR-quasi-compact-above-x}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7334da779f7f9d1bb1d3ca593000ba011bdcd3cc9f75897c3e77518c06923b9b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fcfde1f48180b98a0144bd5f57db00a679f1fe0d2d89cd022312ceec38eee1b0", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nSometimes people say that a point <MATH_0001> satisfying\nthe equivalent conditions of Lemma <REF_0001>\nis a ``<TEXTITOPEN_0001>quasi-compact point<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>''.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:db02628cd95d9b44b164bb64f35398bbe548ab25bedf662d21f5a900fb236252", "unit_id": "tag:0DTJ:prose-0002"}
